{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/SQ","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/SH","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/DijkstraSearchEvent\/discover(_:distance:)","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/DijkstraSearchEvent\/edgeNotRelaxed(_:distance:)","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/DijkstraSearchEvent\/edgeRelaxed(_:distance:)","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/DijkstraSearchEvent\/examine(_:distance:)","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/DijkstraSearchEvent\/examineEdge(_:distance:)","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/DijkstraSearchEvent\/finish(_:distance:)"],"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","generated":true,"title":"Enumeration Cases"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/DijkstraSearchEvent\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/DijkstraSearchEvent\/Equatable-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths"]]},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:13ShortestPaths19DijkstraSearchEventO","modules":[{"name":"ShortestPaths"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","title":"DijkstraSearchEvent","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DijkstraSearchEvent"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DijkstraSearchEvent"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"DijkstraSearch.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/ShortestPaths\/DijkstraSearch.swift#L17"},"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"enum"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DijkstraSearchEvent"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Edge"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Weight"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Edge"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each source is discovered first, at distance zero. Then, while a discovered vertex is not yet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"settled, the one with the smallest distance is examined (settled at that distance), and each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of its out-edges is examined in turn with the distance it offers its target: the examined"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex’s distance plus the edge’s weight. An edge into an unsettled target is then relaxed,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the offer is smaller than the target’s distance or the target was not yet discovered, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not relaxed. A relaxed edge to an undiscovered target is followed by that target’s discovery."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"An edge into a settled vertex, a self-loop included, is examined and nothing more. After its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"last out-edge the examined vertex is finished. Vertices the sources do not reach are never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reported."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/shortestpaths\/dijkstrasearchevent"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"What a Dijkstra search reports, in order, with the events of the Boost Graph Library’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Dijkstra visitor.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/DijkstraSearchEvent"},"references":{"doc://ShortestPaths/s8CopyableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s8CopyableP","title":"Swift.Copyable","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://ShortestPaths/SH":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/SH","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Hashable"},"doc://ShortestPaths/SQ":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/SQ","title":"Swift.Equatable","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://ShortestPaths/documentation/ShortestPaths/DijkstraSearchEvent/examine(_:distance:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/DijkstraSearchEvent\/examine(_:distance:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A vertex leaves the queue: its distance is final.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/shortestpaths\/dijkstrasearchevent\/examine(_:distance:)","kind":"symbol","title":"DijkstraSearchEvent.examine(_:distance:)","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"examine","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"distance","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Weight","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"ty